  Lemma vd2_s1 : forall (ra gp tp x5 x6 x7 s0 s1 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 s2 s3 s4 s5 x22 x23 x24 x25 x26 x27 x28 x29 x30 x31 : word)
